WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
The WTO has 166 members,

2
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.740
covering about 98 per cent of world trade.

3
00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:09.820
Yet countries keep
signing smaller deals too:

4
00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:12.770
with one partner, or with
a group of neighbours.

5
00:00:12.770 --> 00:00:15.490
Some groups go much further
than cutting tariffs.

6
00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:19.650
They even let workers and money
move freely across borders.

7
00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:21.950
So why would a country
give up control over

8
00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:25.380
its own trade rules to join
a club of its neighbours?

9
00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:28.190
In this mission, you'll
climb step by step,

10
00:00:28.190 --> 00:00:31.330
from free trade areas
up to single markets.

11
00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:34.500
Then you'll see what
the WTO can and cannot

12
00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:36.770
do when its members fall out.

13
00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:40.830
Your mission: find out what
joining a trade club really costs.
